✨ Seen (س)

🗣️ Makhraj:
🔹 Zabaan ke darmiyani hisse se awaaz nikalti hai.
🔹 Jab zabaan ke darmiyan aur upar ke saamne ke daanton ke kinare ke darmiyan se hawa nikalti hai to س (Seen) ki awaaz paida hoti hai.

🎙️ Adaaigi:
💨 Hawa zyada chalti hai, is liye yeh Hams (breathy) wala harf hai.
🌀 Zabaan ke darmiyan se hawa nikalti hai.

✨ Saad (ص)

🗣️ Makhraj:
🔹 Seen (س) ke makhraj jaisa hi hai.
🔹 Zabaan ke darmiyani hisse aur upar ke saamne ke daanton ke kinare se zor se hawa nikal kar awaaz banti hai.

🎙️ Adaaigi:
🗯️ Zabaan thodi peeche uthti hai, jisse awaaz moti (Tafkheem) lagti hai.
💨 Hawa ka zyada zor hota hai.

✨ Zaa (ز)

🗣️ Makhraj:
🔹 Seen (س) ke makhraj jaisa hi hai.
🔹 Zabaan ke darmiyani hisse aur upar ke saamne ke daanton ke kinare ke darmiyan se awaaz nikalti hai.
🔸 Farq yeh hai ke Zaa me hawa nahi nikalti, balki awaaz me buzz (gunj) hoti hai.

🎙️ Adaaigi:
🔊 Zabaan thodi andar hoti hai.
🐝 Awaaz me “z z z” jaisa bizzing sound aata hai.

✨ Zwaa / Zhaa (ظ)

🗣️ Makhraj:
🔹 Saa (ث) aur Zaal (ذ) ke jaise hi hai.
🔹 Zabaan ki nok upar ke saamne ke daanton ke kinare se lagti hai.

🎙️ Adaaigi:
💎 Harf mota (Mufakhkham) hai.
🗯️ Awaaz Tafkheem (moti) ke sath nikalti hai.

✨ Taa (ط)

🗣️ Makhraj:
🔹 Daal (د) aur Taa (ت) jaisa hi hai.
🔹 Zabaan zyada zor se lagti hai aur awaaz moti (Tafkheem) hoti hai.

🎙️ Adaaigi:
💪 Zabaan ki nok upar ke saamne ke daanton ke masoodhon se lagti hai.

✨ Taa (ت)

🗣️ Makhraj:
🔹 Zabaan ki nok aur upar ke saamne ke daanton ke masoodhon ke beech hota hai.
🔹 Jab zabaan ki nok upar ke masoodhe se lagti hai to ت ki awaaz nikalti hai.

🎙️ Adaaigi:
💨 Thodi si hawa nikalti hai (Hams).

✨ Daal (د)

🗣️ Makhraj:
🔹 Taa (ت) ke jaise hi hai.
🔹 Zabaan ki nok upar ke masoodhon se lag kar awaaz nikalti hai.

🎙️ Adaaigi:
🔇 Isme hawa nahi nikalti, awaaz band hoti hai.

✨ Saa (ث)

🗣️ Makhraj:
🔹 Zabaan ki nok jab upar ke saamne ke daanton ke thoda bahar nikal kar unke kinare ko chu jaye to yeh awaaz nikalti hai.

🎙️ Adaaigi:
💨 Hawa ke sath soft hiss jaisi awaaz hoti hai — “th” (like in “think”).

